note as PHYSICAL_INDEX_POLICY
  PHYSICAL INDEX POLICY
  - Primary and unique indexes enforce identity and business keys.
  - Every foreign key used for joins/deletes has a supporting BTREE index.
  - Tenant/patient/status/time composites support RLS and operational queues.
  - GIN/GiST/BRIN are used only for justified search, range, geospatial or append-only access.
  - Partial indexes reference stable seeded concept IDs/functions in migrations, never labels.
  - Final inclusion is verified with representative EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS), write cost,
    cardinality and production-like load tests; unused/redundant indexes are rejected.
end note


' ==============================================================================
' v4.2.75 - PERSONAL DE APOYO (secretaria y otros roles). Permisos = filas de
' support_scope_grants con TIPO DE OBJETIVO; varias filas se SUMAN; una fila con dos
' objetivos (doctor x servicio, doctor x ubicacion, servicio x ubicacion) se CRUZA.
' "Todos" existe por nivel (ALL_PRACTITIONERS, ALL_SERVICES, ALL_LOCATIONS, ALL).
' Un permiso por ubicacion (piso/edificio/sede) cubre una cita solo si el ESPACIO de la
' cita esta dentro de esa ubicacion (care_spaces.location_path). Permiso por doctor cubre
' todos sus lugares. Permiso por servicio cubre ese servicio. Cada permiso trae sus
' propias acciones (support_grant_actions). Sin ON DELETE CASCADE.
' ==============================================================================

' Destinos de las FK de este bloque, declarados en su modulo dueno.
